  "description": "**Original Webtoon :**   \n[Kakao](https://page.kakao.com/content/69579435/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%8A%B8%EB%9D%BC%EB%B2%A0%EC%8A%A4%ED%8B%B0-%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%9C-%ED%99%A9%EC%9E%90%EA%B0%80-%EB%90%98%EC%97%88%EB%8B%A4/4909)\n\nLeticia, the Empire's youngest death row inmate, was released on condition. The Emperor demanded only one thing in releasing her:\n\n\"You must become my son.\" \n\nThat is, to play the role of the youngest prince, who was to be sent as a hostage to the Grand Duchy.\n\n\"You are going to die anyway, so die as a prince.\"\n\nFrom that day on, Leticia Borba became a fake prince. To die in place of the real prince.",
